  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of coconut oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add finely chopped onion and saut\u000640 until soft.",
    "Add grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add turmeric, coriander, and cumin powder and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in 1 cup of coconut milk and 1 cup of water.",
    "Add salt to taste and stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in 1 teaspoon of ground nutmeg.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot in a lacquerware bowl."
